1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,233
Day three. The engine room. Pipes as
thick as trees. And a generator the
size of a bus.

2
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:09,967
Kai says it starts. You crank it. It
coughs. Gray smoke fills the room.

3
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:16,033
Rule nine. Never run an engine in a
closed room. The smoke that kills you
has no smell.

4
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:22,167
Exhaust gas can make you dizzy, then
sleepy, then gone. Open the door. Open
the hatch. Let it out.
